  {
   "id": "s04",
   "text": {
    "en": "We call them echoes. They come out of the fog after the thirteenth bell, and they copy people. Perfectly. The face, the clothes, the voice. Even the memories. An echo knows your birthday. It knows your secrets. It knows the name of your first pet."
