  {
   "id": "s05",
   "text": {
    "en": "It started eighty years ago. A baker named Tomas was walking home late, when the bell rang thirteen times. His wife heard a knock and opened the door. It was Tomas. Ten minutes later, there was another knock. She opened the door again. And it was Tomas. Again."
