  {
   "id": "s07",
   "text": {
    "en": "She chose. And the next morning, the other Tomas was gone. For the rest of her life, people said Tomas was different. He never slept. He never got sick. And every night at midnight, he stood at the window, smiling at the street. She had picked the wrong one."
