  {
   "id": "s09",
   "text": {
    "en": "Last spring, it happened to my friend Nina. Her dad got stuck at work, and came home after the bell. Twice. One dad at the front door, and one at the garden gate. Both of them were crying. Nina's mom couldn't choose, so she didn't. She just waited for the sun. And in the morning, there was only one dad left."
