  {
   "id": "s11",
   "text": {
    "en": "Only one person in our town ever told the difference. Old Mister Gray, across the street. Forty years ago, two of his wife came home on the same night. He picked the right one. Just like that. When people ask him how, he only says one thing. The light tells the truth. Nobody knows what that means. He never explains."
   },
