  {
   "id": "s12",
   "text": {
    "en": "And then came yesterday. Mom had a night shift at the hospital, so it was just me and my little brother, Milo. He's seven. He has a yellow hoodie he never takes off. And when he gets scared, he smiles. A big, goofy smile. Mom says it's his superpower."
