  {
   "id": "s13",
   "text": {
    "en": "Around eleven, we were playing soccer in front of our house. Milo kicked the ball way too hard, and it rolled down the street. He ran after it. I yelled at him to come back. And then, from the middle of town, the clock tower started ringing."
